WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.910
- [Kelly Clarkson] There are
countless stories online,

00:00:01.910 --> 00:00:04.130
but this is the time I
present the best of the best.

00:00:04.130 --> 00:00:05.136
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.136 --> 00:00:08.510
(upbeat music)

00:00:08.510 --> 00:00:09.720
All right. So let's face it.

00:00:09.720 --> 00:00:11.840
It's tough for restaurant
workers these days,

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:14.070
between the pandemic
and grouchy customers,

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:15.980
no one has it easy, which is why

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:18.539
this next story is so
cool and so heartwarming.

00:00:18.539 --> 00:00:21.310
When a restaurant in London
found out a blind woman was

00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:23.810
celebrating her birthday,
check out what they did.

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:27.429
(dishes clinking)

00:00:27.429 --> 00:00:29.080
- Here you go, we want to wish you

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:30.497
a happy birthday.

00:00:32.111 --> 00:00:32.980
Thank you!

00:00:32.980 --> 00:00:35.900
- [Woman] So Nat, um I want you

00:00:35.900 --> 00:00:37.163
to give me your hand.

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:47.273
(gasps) Hang on.

00:00:49.865 --> 00:00:51.947
No freaking way!

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.693
They did not!

00:00:55.974 --> 00:00:57.812
- You guys are amazing.

00:00:57.812 --> 00:01:01.081
Oh my gosh! Are you kidding me?

00:01:01.081 --> 00:01:03.822
(laughs)

00:01:03.822 --> 00:01:05.185
(applause)

00:01:05.185 --> 00:01:06.900
- I'm like every time it gets me,

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:08.580
it's the coolest thing ever.

00:01:08.580 --> 00:01:09.590
How sweet is that?

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:11.980
So we have that customer
on the line right now.

00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:13.676
What's up Natalie?

00:01:13.676 --> 00:01:15.940
- [Natalie] Hi Kelly. Oh my gosh.

00:01:15.940 --> 00:01:17.240
It's so exciting to meet you.

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:18.080
How are you?

00:01:18.080 --> 00:01:19.470
- Oh my gosh. I'm so great.

00:01:19.470 --> 00:01:21.130
And honestly, I watch
the video every time and

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:21.963
it's just, first of all,

00:01:21.963 --> 00:01:23.530
it's so cool that they
went out of their way,

00:01:23.530 --> 00:01:24.770
like who knew that they would know Braille

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:25.740
and how to do that.

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:26.820
Like, and it was just so cool.

00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:29.684
Your reaction was so like
joyful and so exciting

00:01:29.684 --> 00:01:32.370
and also was it a good birthday?

00:01:32.370 --> 00:01:34.440
- It was incredible.
Absolutely incredible.

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:35.905
I saw a show on the west
end with my producer,

00:01:35.905 --> 00:01:37.374
we went out for dinner, and oh,

00:01:37.374 --> 00:01:39.160
just so many more things.

00:01:39.160 --> 00:01:39.993
It was incredible.

00:01:39.993 --> 00:01:40.826
- Oh my gosh.

00:01:40.826 --> 00:01:42.690
Well what's really incredible
is that the restaurant

00:01:42.690 --> 00:01:43.996
didn't even know you were coming.

00:01:43.996 --> 00:01:45.785
So this wasn't even planned, right?

00:01:45.785 --> 00:01:48.210
- No, we had no reservation.

00:01:48.210 --> 00:01:50.716
We just walked in. They
found out I was blind,

00:01:50.716 --> 00:01:52.945
that it was my birthday, and at one point

00:01:52.945 --> 00:01:54.494
my producer got up to go to the bathroom

00:01:54.494 --> 00:01:56.996
and they asked her if they could do this,

00:01:56.996 --> 00:02:01.043
they said yes, and it went from there.

00:02:01.043 --> 00:02:03.450
It was, it was absolutely incredible.

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:05.710
- It was so, like you figuring out

00:02:05.710 --> 00:02:08.196
what happened is happening
is the coolest moment.

00:02:08.196 --> 00:02:09.100
Oh my God.

00:02:09.100 --> 00:02:10.830
It makes me feel so good.

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:12.270
It must have been the world to you, right?

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:14.090
Just somebody like, you know,
took the time to do that.

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:15.105
And it wasn't even planned.

00:02:15.105 --> 00:02:17.694
- Exactly. It was unbelievable.

00:02:17.694 --> 00:02:19.454
I, I mean, first of all,

00:02:19.454 --> 00:02:22.457
it was such a surprise
because when Claire said,

00:02:22.457 --> 00:02:23.494
"Give me your hand" I mean, obviously,

00:02:23.494 --> 00:02:25.705
you know, being blind, you can't just

00:02:25.705 --> 00:02:27.730
glance down and see that someone's

00:02:27.730 --> 00:02:29.000
put a dessert out in front of you.

00:02:29.000 --> 00:02:32.385
So, you know, putting
out my hand, not knowing

00:02:32.385 --> 00:02:35.040
what to expect and then
feeling "happy birthday"

00:02:35.040 --> 00:02:37.940
packed in melted chocolate when
I didn't even know anything

00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:40.802
was happening, it was just,
I, yeah, it blew my mind.

00:02:40.802 --> 00:02:45.802
And I, I spent the entire
night just a mess afterwards,

00:02:47.004 --> 00:02:49.750
the camera goes off and I'm crying.

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:51.522
The staff's crying,
people around me crying.

00:02:51.522 --> 00:02:53.700
But what was really funny was that

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:55.160
I didn't even know it was going to happen.

00:02:55.160 --> 00:02:57.750
So they asked at one point,

00:02:57.750 --> 00:02:58.877
they came over to us and they said,

00:02:58.877 --> 00:03:01.700
"Oh, we'd love to bring you
a complimentary dessert"

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:04.040
And I go, "Oh, thank you so much,

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:05.630
but we actually already
have plans for dessert."

00:03:05.630 --> 00:03:06.498
So I was like, no, no, no

00:03:06.498 --> 00:03:08.730
(laughs)

00:03:08.730 --> 00:03:10.770
So I was definitely
giving them pointed looks

00:03:10.770 --> 00:03:11.937
being like, no, no, no.

00:03:11.937 --> 00:03:13.280
"We'd love to stay for
a complimentary dessert

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:14.520
wouldn't we Natalie?"

00:03:14.520 --> 00:03:16.244
And I was like "yeah
that would be amazing."

00:03:16.244 --> 00:03:18.372
- And first of all, Natalie,

00:03:18.372 --> 00:03:21.140
we never turned down free dessert.

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:22.510
Who turns down free dessert.

00:03:22.510 --> 00:03:23.510
- I know! What was I thinking?

00:03:23.510 --> 00:03:25.014
- That's crazy, Natalie.

00:03:25.014 --> 00:03:28.240
Oh my God. Well, I'm so glad
you had such a great birthday.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:29.934
I'm so glad people made
you feel as special

00:03:29.934 --> 00:03:31.610
as you obviously are.

00:03:31.610 --> 00:03:34.040
Thank you so much, we're
liking your posts right now.

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:35.237
Right?

00:03:35.237 --> 00:03:36.690
- Aww, Thank you so much.

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:38.620
- Absolutely. Oh, and that's not all

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:40.140
our season long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:03:40.140 --> 00:03:41.480
makers of FriXion, the go-to

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:42.836
erasable pen of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:03:42.836 --> 00:03:44.922
they want to celebrate
those creating fearlessly,

00:03:44.922 --> 00:03:45.870
just like you.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:48.000
So in celebration, they are giving you

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:49.545
a thousand dollars, how does that sound?

00:03:49.545 --> 00:03:52.004
- Wow. Oh my gosh!

00:03:52.004 --> 00:03:54.034
- That's a lot of dessert, Natalie.

00:03:54.034 --> 00:03:56.010
Go get all the dessert you want.

00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:56.843
That's what I say.

00:03:56.843 --> 00:03:58.265
(laughs)

00:03:58.265 --> 00:03:59.265
- Thank you.

